    "text": "<p>(a) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>COOCH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mover><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>OH</mi></math> (Hydrolysis of ester)</p><p>(b) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>COOCH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mrow><mi>DIBAL</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></mover><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>CHO</mi></math> (Reduction of ester)</p><p>(c) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mrow><msub><mi>SnCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>HCl</mi><mo>/</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mover><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>CHO</mi></math> (Reduction followed by hydrolysis)</p><p>(d)&nbsp;<img src=\"assets\\st0030_146ddbdaef8f.png\" style=\"width: 435px; height: 90px;\" />&nbsp;(Nucleophillic addition reaction)</p>"
